	<section_number>15.2-1111</section_number>
	<catch_line>Regulation of cemeteries and burials</catch_line>
	<text>
		A municipal corporation may regulate and inspect cemeteries and burials therein, prescribe records to be kept by the owners thereof, and prohibit burials except in public cemeteries.
	</text>
	<history>Code 1950, § 15-77.24; 1958, c. 328; 1962, c. 623, § 15.1-860; 1997, c. 587.</history>
